eType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":195570330,"text":"本当にめでたいことだよ。あんなに走り回ったのも、無駄じゃなかったな。","nextNodeIds":[710390204]},{"nodeId":710390204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":654020170,"text":"彼女ならもうやめた。","nextNodeIds":[710390205]},{"nodeId":710390205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":1921503890,"text":"やめた？それってどういう…？ここを離れたという意味か？だが、層岩巨淵を離れた人がいるなんて情報、千岩軍から聞かされていないが…","nextNodeIds":[710390206]},{"nodeId":710390206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":116138106,"text":"志璇は探検隊をやめた。","nextNodeIds":[710390207]},{"nodeId":710390207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":2947725002,"text":"えっ？そうなのか…","nextNodeIds":[710390208]},{"nodeId":710390208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":3845761450,"text":"いや、待て！","nextNodeIds":[710390209]},{"nodeId":710390209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":4271885578,"text":"いやいや…か、彼女が探検隊をやめたって？","nextNodeIds":[710390210]},{"nodeId":710390210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":2444568898,"text":"志璇が？やめた？","nextNodeIds":[710390211]},{"nodeId":710390211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":449194650,"text":"だからそう言ってるだろ！","nextNodeIds":[710390212]},{"nodeId":710390212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":363020946,"text":"…そうか、直ちに救助隊を手配しよう。まだ層岩巨淵にいるのなら、彼女を見つけられるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[710390213]},{"nodeId":710390213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":3085916498,"text":"理由がどうあれ…まずは彼女を見つけるのが先決だ。","nextNodeIds":[710390214]},{"nodeId":710390214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":1216633474,"text":"彼女の今の状態からして、隊を離脱したのは完全に無茶な行動だ…","nextNodeIds":[710390215,710390217]},{"nodeId":710390215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":542266314,"text":"手伝いはいる？","nextNodeIds":[710390216]},{"nodeId":710390216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":73219914,"text":"すまないが、今回は必要ない…俺もたまには自分で解決しないとな。","nextNodeIds":[710390233]},{"nodeId":710390233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3525898938,"text":"手伝いが必要なら、すぐに駆けつける。","nextNodeIds":[710390234]},{"nodeId":710390234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1015686322,"text":"おう、オイラもだ！後輩を放ってはおけないからな！","nextNodeIds":[710390235]},{"nodeId":710390235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3497867706,"text":"オイラたちも気にかけておこうぜ。どこかで偶然見つかるかもしれないしな。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710390217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1732317826,"text":"志璇について…","nextNodeIds":[710390218]},{"nodeId":710390218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":149252970,"text":"あんなやつだが、それでも大事な友人だ。俺が人に好かれるような性質じゃないのは分かってるが…それでも、友人のことを忘れるわけにはいかない。","nextNodeIds":[710390219]},{"nodeId":710390219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":4165410074,"text":"あいつはいつも冒険者を夢見ていて、以前も何度か大怪我をした…命をも落とすところだった。やっと落ち着いたかと思いきや…","nextNodeIds":[710390220]},{"nodeId":710390220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":1544933610,"text":"もうあの無茶な夢は忘れたと思っていたのに…ロアルドやスタンレーになるなんて、そう簡単にいくわけないだろ！","nextNodeIds":[710390221]},{"nodeId":710390221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":1402877730,"text":"でもまさか…はぁ…今回はあんたを層岩巨淵に招くべきじゃなかった。また志璇のやる気にスイッチが入ってしまうなんて…","nextNodeIds":[710390222,710390226]},{"nodeId":710390222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1708719418,"text":"でも彼女の努力は無駄じゃなかった。","nextNodeIds":[710390223]},{"nodeId":710390223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":159302682,"text":"無駄じゃない…？それはちょっと功利的すぎる言い方だな。地下の地図を描いてくれた彼女には感謝している…だが…","nextNodeIds":[710390224]},{"nodeId":710390224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":2465455106,"text":"「願い」なんて雲をつかむようなことを、命よりも優先させるなんて…","nextNodeIds":[710390225]},{"nodeId":710390225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":27651778,"text":"俺は全く理解できないぜ。そんなことのために、自分を危険にさらすなんてあり得ない。","nextNodeIds":[710390232]},{"nodeId":710390232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":3197935938,"text":"だから、彼女を探すことについては、俺に任せてくれ…いや、千岩軍の救助隊に任せると言ったほうが正しいか…","nextNodeIds":[710390233]},{"nodeId":710390226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3959547242,"text":"でもこれは彼女が選んだ道。","nextNodeIds":[710390227]},{"nodeId":710390227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":1086121650,"text":"選んだ道…そんなのおかしいぞ！彼女は死に急いでる、あんたはそれが分からないのか？","nextNodeIds":[710390228]},{"nodeId":710390228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":442730786,"text":"コホン…すまない、少し言い過ぎた。だが…あんな人間ごときにはどうしようもない状況…彼女は冷静に対処するべきだった。","nextNodeIds":[710390229]},{"nodeId":710390229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":1504185090,"text":"あと二三十年…もしくは十年経っていれば、もっと安全な地下装置ができているかもしれない。その時は急いで地下の地図を描く必要もなくなる。","nextNodeIds":[710390230]},{"nodeId":710390230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":3576953706,"text":"でも彼女は待たなかった…そう、彼女は若いうちに、他人が一生を捧げないと達成できない仕事に尽力した。","nextNodeIds":[710390231]},{"nodeId":710390231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"沐寧","textMapHash":3679496626,"text":"あいつはバカだ…俺は友達として、無視するわけにはいかない。","nextNodeIds":[710390232]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7103902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"tr